  "schema:name": "Deaths, Year of registration, Indigenous status, Summary data, Sex, States, Territories and Australia",
  "schema:description": "Dataset: DEATHS_INDIGENOUS_SUMMARY. Characteristics of the deceased: place of usual residence, age at death, sex, Indigenous status and country of birth. Includes infant deaths and death rates. Death statistics are used in the calculation of quarterly population estimates and in the analysis of mortality in Australia. Unit of measure: Births/Deaths/Age/Ratios. Geographic coverage: Australia/State. Catalogue number: 3302.0",
